SwiftLaya

This project includes a Swift adaptation of Laya by Nandakishor (NandhaKishorM):
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya

The upstream Python reference and existing Apache License 2.0 are retained.
SwiftLaya modifications are distributed under the same Apache License 2.0.
Files under Sources/Laya adapt the upstream schema, packing, postprocessing,
language routing, presets, and email utilities. The optional tokenizer library
and converted model artifacts retain their own applicable licenses and notices.
